<h2>Segment lens</h2>
<p>Lead-acid demand in the region is driven by vehicle replacement and telecom backup; lithium demand by EV, two-wheelers and storage. A country can be a large producer and a small consumer, or the reverse. Read the segment pages before assuming that a production figure translates into local availability.</p>
